*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0021
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-07-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 160
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0021.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 WS-CSCR            PIC 9(3).
    *> GROSS ANNUAL INCOME
    05 AI-AMT             PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> ASSIGNED CREDIT LIMIT
    05 WS-CLIM            PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM ASSIGN-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "WS-CLIM=" WS-CLIM
    STOP RUN.
ASSIGN-LIMIT.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF WS-CSCR >= 600
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF WS-CSCR GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 750
        COMPUTE WS-CLIM = AI-AMT * 0.30
    ELSE
        *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT
        IF WS-CSCR >= 680
            COMPUTE WS-CLIM = AI-AMT * 0.20
        ELSE
            MOVE 500 TO WS-CLIM
        END-IF
    END-IF.
